<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 27.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 27.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 27	Jan 24	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  256.320     256.000     247.020    3.76 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.900     304.150     306.830   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.560     156.740     158.970   -1.52 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.434	46.484	47.182   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  416.280     417.260     419.180   -0.69 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.380     139.645     141.685   -1.63 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.075	16.081	16.185   -0.68 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.820     215.040     212.430    1.13 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.861	 1.862	 1.888   -1.43 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.567	 1.565	 1.581   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.085     181.120     183.135   -1.12 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
